<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <title>Welcome to PH Healthcare System</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f7f7f7; color: #333; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 520px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; padding: 32px; border-radius: 8px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
      h2 { color: #1e293b; margin-top: 0; }
      .credential-box { background: #f0f4ff; border: 1px solid #d0e0ff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 16px; margin: 20px 0; font-size: 14px; }
      .credential-item { margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .credential-item:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
      .credential-label { font-weight: bold; color: #1d4ed8; font-size: 13px; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .credential-value { font-family: monospace; font-size: 15px; color: #111; margin-top: 4px; }
      .warning-box { background: #fffbeb; border-left: 4px solid #f59e0b; padding: 12px 16px; margin-top: 20px; font-size: 13px; color: #92400e; border-radius: 4px; }
      .footer { margin-top: 32px; font-size: 12px; color: #94a3b8; border-top: 1px solid #e2e8f0; padding-top: 16px; text-align: center; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h2>Welcome to PH Healthcare System, <%= name %>!</h2>
      <p>An administrative account with the role of <strong><%= role === 'SUPER_ADMIN' ? 'Super Admin' : 'Admin' %></strong> has been created for you.</p>
      
      <div class="credential-box">
        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="credential-label">Organization Email (Login Identity)</div>
          <div class="credential-value"><%= organizationEmail %></div>
        </div>
        <div class="credential-item">
          <div class="credential-label">Generated Password</div>
          <div class="credential-value"><%= password %></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="warning-box">
        <strong>Security Notice:</strong> Please log in to your account and change your password immediately.
      </div>

      <p style="margin-top: 20px; font-size: 14px; color: #475569;">
        You can access the admin dashboard using your organization email and the generated password above.
      </p>

      <div class="footer">&copy; PH Healthcare System. All rights reserved.</div>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
